+
+// SSL_check_client_session_x509 revalidates the immutable cached peer chain
+// against the current SSL verification parameters and trust store, without
+// invoking application authentication callbacks. Returns zero if the policy
+// cannot be checked or the chain is unacceptable. No error queue entries from
+// the attempted verification are left behind.
